OL,3,GNEWSAFurther searches take place over
OL,4,Adisappearance of Carrie Mullane
OL,5,
OL,6,FDetectives investigating the
OL,7,Fdisappearance and suspected murder of
OL,8,Fmissing Limerick woman Carrie Mullane
OL,9,Fare conducting further searches in the
OL,10,FEnniskillen area.
OL,12,FMullane, 39, has been missing since she
OL,13,Farrived in Enniskillen from Limerick on
OL,14,F10 October 2026.
OL,16,FOn Saturday, a 35-year-old man appeared
OL,17,Fin court charged with her murder and
OL,18,Fpreventing lawful burial.
OL,20,FTwo other people are still being
OL,21,Fquestioned by detectives investigating
OL,22,Fwhat happened to Mullane.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
